title: A staged rename whose file was changed afterwards, and a file deleted on disk: the panel and the diff show them, the deleted file is staged and unstaged, discarded (it comes back); discarding the renamed file says something sane and loses nothing
folders: git-rename-staged
expect-file: git-rename-staged/src/removed.rs :: ^pub fn removed\(\) \{\}\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers

wait 3000
left changes
wait 500
mark 1-panel
wait 500
diff on
wait 1500
goto src/new_name.rs
wait 1200
mark 2-diff-renamed
wait 500
diff off
wait 800
part stage src/new_name.rs 2
wait 1500
mark 3-part-staged
wait 500
git stage src/removed.rs
wait 1200
mark 4-deletion-staged
wait 500
git unstage src/removed.rs
wait 1200
git discard src/removed.rs
wait 600
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark 5-deleted-file-back
wait 500
git discard src/new_name.rs
wait 600
mark 6-asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark 7-renamed-discarded
wait 500
quit
